\b 2026-03-20 19:02:11\b0\par
- Version: 0.2.4\par
- Firmware Version: 0.1.21\par
- Summary: Bridge firmware SO_SNDTIMEO fix, downlink rate reduction, state machine bug fixes, comprehensive error handling, COM port release in scripts, and bridge design description document.\par
- Notes: irmware/esp32c3_bridge/main/CommunicationFunctions.c now sets SO_SNDTIMEO=50ms on the TCP client socket after accept() to prevent blocking send() from stalling the USB JTAG receive loop and causing byte loss. server/sim/data_payload.py DOWNLINK_INTERVAL_S reduced from 0.1s to 0.5s (2 Hz) to reduce USB JTAG load. server/sim/link_state_machine.py fixed three bugs: added _check_port_alive_locked() to detect serial port closure mid-session, fixed close_transport() to set RESET state, fixed force_release_transport() to stop data_payload_manager before acquiring the state machine lock. Added import traceback + print to all background thread exception handlers in link_state_machine.py, serial_link.py, data_payload.py, and routes.py. Added Invoke-SimulatorComRelease to idfw.ps1, flash_hidden.ps1, and monitor_capture.ps1 for both server and client projects so COM4 is released before flash or monitor. Added scripts/generate_bridge_design_diagrams.ps1 (9 System.Drawing PNGs) and scripts/generate_bridge_design_docx.ps1 (full bridge design description document); output to docs/bridge_diagrams/ and docs/bridge_design_description.docx.\par
\par
\b 2026-03-19 (estimated)\b0\par
- Version: 0.2.3\par
- Firmware Version: 0.1.20\par
- Summary: Added binary data payload channel between Python simulator and ESP32-S3 client via ESP32-C3 bridge.\par
- Notes: Added irmware/esp32c3_bridge/main/data_payload.h and data_payload.c implementing a typed binary DATA frame with 20-float realtime array and uplink FIFO. Added server/sim/data_payload.py with DataPayloadManager (downlink send thread at 100ms, uplink receive FIFO). Updated server/sim/link_state_machine.py to route DATA frames to data_payload_manager and integrate binary send. Updated irmware/esp32c3_bridge/main/CommunicationFunctions.c with binary send support, larger TCP/USB buffers (600B payload), and DATA frame routing. Updated CMakeLists.txt to include data_payload.c. BRIDGE_FRAME_MAX_PAYLOAD increased to 600. Downlink packet: 535 bytes (magic 0xD0 + seq + 100f + 20i + 50s). Uplink packet: 539 bytes (magic 0xD1 + seq + timestamp_ms + 100f + 20i + 50s).\par
\par
